. *==================================================*
. * Table A4. Robustness tests for alternative wildfire indicators
. *==================================================*
. 
. preserve
{txt}
{com}. drop if south_state != 1
{txt}(0 observations deleted)

{com}. 
. eststo clear
{txt}
{com}. xtset fips year
{res}{txt}{col 8}panel variable:  {res}fips (strongly balanced)
{txt}{col 9}time variable:  {res}{col 25}year, 1995 to 2023
{txt}{col 17}delta:  {res}1 unit
{txt}
{com}. 
. local mark "$\checkmark$"
{txt}
{com}. 
. local outcomes1 logmtbs_acre mtbs_d mtbs_acre_p fema_count
{txt}
{com}. 
. *****************************************************
